{"campaign_version":"storage-taxonomy-v2-20260813","canonical":{"bri_country":"Yes","category":"综合能源","country":"埃及,约旦","country_iso":"EGY","created_at":"2026-04-10T08:37:34.223988","excluded":0,"excluded_reason":null,"id":"EGY-HB-0014","ldc":"No","location":"","location_norm":null,"name_en_quality":"ai_translated","project_name":"埃及约旦411MW清洁能源项目","project_name_en":"Egypt Jordan 411MW Clean Energy Project (Alcazar)","subcategory":null},"events":[{"articles":[{"author":"三峡国际","content":"8月19日，三峡国际所属三峡南亚公司顺利完成Alcazar项目交割，标志着三峡集团将境外清洁能源投资业务拓展到中东北非区域，为进一步开拓亚洲和非洲市场奠定了良好基础。\nAlcazar项目包含位于埃及和约旦境内的5座光伏电站和2座风电站，总装机41.1万千瓦。\n三峡国际凭借在国际清洁能源市场长期积累的良好声誉和丰富开发经验，与国际金融公司（IFC）、丝路基金等长期友好合作伙伴团结协作，克服新冠疫情困难，经过审慎研究和艰苦谈判，一举获得该项目并顺利实现交割。\nAlcazar项目顺利交割，是三峡国际积极践行“一带一路”倡议、高质量贯彻落实三峡集团“十四五”发展规划的又一成果。\n三峡国际将高效做好该项目投后管理整合和相关经营管理工作，持续稳妥开拓海外清洁能源市场，推动三峡国际业务高质量发展。","content_sha256":"960e4aa292e41d5a7991a1f7b559b8d22cdca958d776eb324379d472e7939ae0","id":18235,"publish_date":"2021-08-24 09:30:17","title":"Alcazar项目完成交割！三峡集团成功进入中东、北非清洁能源投资市场","title_sha256":"7e4d14c74bb2e30ef245380d74e95ad5646a93edb2b81a58eac1cd4baff9ecaf","url":"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/22028.html"}],"event":{"additional_remarks":"","canonical_id":"EGY-HB-0014","capacity_details":"PV: 5座光伏电站, Wind: 2座风电站","capacity_mw":411.0,"capacity_mw_raw":"411","capacity_source":"legacy","contract_amount_usd":null,"contract_amount_usd_raw":null,"created_at":"2026-04-10T08:37:34.227411","financing_amount_usd":null,"financing_amount_usd_raw":null,"financing_model":"Unknown","financing_model_details":"","id":"EGY-HB-0014-01","investment_date":"2021-08-19","line_length_km":null,"needs_manual_review":0,"non_official_website_links":"[]","official_website_links":"[\"https://www.ctg.com.cn/sxjt/xwzx55/zhxw23/1432269/index.html\"]","planned_complete_date":"","planned_start_date":"","production_capacity_unit":null,"production_capacity_value":null,"project_developer":"三峡国际能源投资集团有限公司","project_developer_en":"CTGI","project_stage":"收购","projec